  // Maru's letters
  "mail.T1.title": "Processor Press",
  "mail.T1.text": "Hi @!^^I've been tinkering with a little press that squeezes bars and quartz into chips. I call them processors. You can also make copper wire with them in mind.^^Here's how to build both. Let me know what you make!^^   -Maru",
  "mail.T2.title": "Farm computer",
  "mail.T2.text": "@!^^You've made a lot of processors! Want to put them to work?^^Build a Computer Core, put a Storage Rack and a Power Rack beside it, and run wire to a Terminal and your chests. Disks hold your items, and the Terminal can craft from everything on the network.^^Battery Packs keep it running for about two weeks each.^^   -Maru"
